"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Step 1: Download the Bridging Template</strong></span></span></p><ol style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Navigate to <strong>Submissions</strong>.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Locate the relevant <strong>client</strong> and their income source .</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Select <strong>View and Submit</strong> on the client's row.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Select <strong>Digital</strong> <strong>Records</strong>.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Select <strong>Download</strong> <strong>Sample</strong> <strong>File</strong>.</span></span></li></ol><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Navigation: Submissions &gt; View and Submit &gt; Digital Records &gt; Download Sample File</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><br></p><table style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; max-width: 100%; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; empty-cells: show; cursor: default; color: rgb(18, 51, 76); font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orp