 Name – the customer, supplier or relevant party.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Invoice date – the date of the transaction.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Transaction Type – select whether the transaction is Income or Expense.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Category – select the relevant income or expense category (e.g., turnover, cost of goods, travel, &nbsp;Admin cost).</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Amount – &nbsp;the value of the transaction in pounds sterling.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">IsDisAllowable – indicate whether the expense is disallowable for tax (Sole Trader template only). If the transaction is disallowable, select Yes</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The template also includes an <strong>Adjustments&nbsp;</strong>section. Complete the following fields where applicable:</span></span></p><ul style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\" type=\"disc\"><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Date&nbsp;</strong></span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Particulars&nbsp;</strong></span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Amount&nbsp;</strong></span></span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Once all required information has been entered, save the completed template</span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Please see image below :</span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9253000252/original/gtgU8FxVjDz0EUWUUe4WD_sRGhSnBgvqYw.gif?1787126290\" style=\"width: 718px; max-width: 100%; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9253000252\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Step 3: Upload the Bridging Template</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Once the template has been completed and saved:</span></span></p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\" type=\"1\"><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Return to the client's <strong>Digital Records</strong> section.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Select <strong>Browse</strong>.</span></span></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Select the completed Bridging Template from your computer and <strong>next&nbsp;</strong>.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Review the warning message displayed by Capium and select the checkbox to confirm that you want to proceed.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Select <strong>Yes</strong> to upload the records.</span></span></li></ol><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(18, 51, 76); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Navigation:&nbsp;</span> Submissions &gt; View and Submit &gt; Digital Records &gt; Browse</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Please see image below :</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9253067344/original/xAGZoXlxQdWGUwoB1b16ewdkbn2N8y0x7Q.gif?1787226914\" style=\"width: 718px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9253067344\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Step 4: View the Uploaded Records</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Once the template has been uploaded, Capium will validate the records and display the results in separate Successful, Duplicate and Error lists.</span></span></p><ul style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\" type=\"disc\"><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Successful records:</strong> These are records that have been uploaded and populated correctly in the client's digital records.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Duplicate records:</strong> system will flag any duplicated records within the template .</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Error records:</strong> These are records that could not be populated correctly. This may occur when information in the Bridging Template is not in the required format, for example, where a field contains a comma or unsupported special character.</span></span></li></ul><p><br></p><table style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; max-width: 100%; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; empty-cells: show; cursor: default; color: rgb(18, 51, 76); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 14px; text-align: start; width: 96%; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; margin-left: calc(4%);\"><tbody style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: none; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 4px; min-width: 5px; user-select: text; cursor: text; font-size: 14px; border: 1px solid rgb(175, 175, 175); width: 749.271px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(235, 107, 86); text-align: left;\"><strong>Important:</strong><strong dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</strong>The Bridging Template is the source of truth for your digital records. You cannot edit transaction details directly within the software. If you need to make changes, update the Bridging Template and upload the updated file.</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Please see image below :</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9253067373/original/b2jiLkCjgbLNVgYFG_D8bC6-g1Wkqtfy-Q.gif?1787226946\" style=\"width: 718px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9253067373\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Re-uploading the Bridging Template</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">If you need to update or replace existing transactions, make the required changes in the Bridging Template and <strong>follow Steps 3 and 4 above</strong> to upload and review the updated records.</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">When re-uploading a template, a confirmation message will appear like shown below:</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9253067138/original/F2fi2awzhJquUskUBMxrlAgnwQHnveqTYg.png?1787226535\" style=\"width: 718px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9253067138\"></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Review the message carefully, select the checkbox to confirm, and select <strong>Yes</strong> to proceed.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><table style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; max-width: 100%; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; empty-cells: show; cursor: default; color: rgb(18, 51, 76); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; width: 96%; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; margin-left: calc(4%);\"><tbody style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 4px; min-width: 5px; cursor: text; font-size: 14px; border: 1px solid rgb(175, 175, 175); width: 749.271px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(235, 107, 86);\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(18, 51, 76); word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Important</strong>: Re-uploading a template permanently replaces the existing digital records with the information contained in the uploaded file. Make sure the file includes all records you want to retain before proceeding.&nbsp;</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Next steps</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Once the digital records have been imported and reviewed, return to <strong><a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/9000276690-mtd-it-choosing-the-right-workflow\">MTD IT: Bridging Workflow (Workflow 1)</a></strong> and continue with the next stage of the MTD IT submission process.</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Related Articles</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/9000276690-mtd-it-choosing-the-right-workflow\">MTD IT - Choosing the right workflow</a></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/9000276517-mtd-it-bridging-template-workflow-workflow-1-\">MTD IT: Bridging Template Workflow (Workflow 1)&nbsp;</a></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/9000275780-mtd-it-adding-new-clients\">MTD IT - Adding New Clients : Capium Support - Click here for help</a>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/9000277688-mtd-it-sync-sources-from-hmrc\">MTD IT: Sync Sources from HMRC | Capium Support : Capium Support - Click here for help</a>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-